      "hash": "13e1a8383fcc411a",
      "id": "intro.1",
      "kind": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "c": [
        {
          "t": "text",
          "v": "SARS checks tax invoices against a fixed list. If one required item is missing, the whole invoice can be disallowed. No tax invoice is required at R50 or less. An abridged tax invoice is allowed from R50 up to R5,000. A full tax invoice is required above R5,000. You must issue it within 21 days of the sale."
        }
      ],
